stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: message · routine · trigger · handoff
  queued --> running: a worker takes the job (one at a time per chat)
  running --> waiting_approval: policy says ask (the worker is freed)
  waiting_approval --> queued: approved, edited or denied (resume job)
  waiting_approval --> expired: nobody answered in time (no answer = no)
  running --> succeeded: final answer saved
  running --> queued: worker died, retried from the last checkpoint
  running --> failed: error after retries, or a limit was hit
  running --> needs_attention: a risky call may or may not have happened
  needs_attention --> queued: a person says retry or skip
  running --> cancelled: you press Stop
  waiting_approval --> cancelled: you press Stop
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  expired --> [*]
